{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"36355","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v50152","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"可哀想","creatorId":"vndb:s36989","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:40712","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s36989","name":"可哀想","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:278393","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"和泉万夜","creatorId":"vndb:s217","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:1614","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s217","name":"和泉万夜","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:278394","source":"egs"}],"music":[],"other":[{"creditedName":"ゆあタン","creatorId":"vndb:s24706","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s24706","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s24706","name":"ゆあタン","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:205658","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c138558","characterName":"桐谷 育美","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"160628","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"501681"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25770"],"vndbCharacterId":"c138558"},"originalCharacterName":"桐谷 育美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"120"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"M"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"171"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"98"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"65"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The mother of Natsuki, and the protagonist's step mother. She is a toxic woman who deceived the protagonist's father into marrying her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When her husband is not around, she shows her true colors and treats the protagonist as if he were an intruder. However, a hypnotic drug causes her to misidentify the protagonist as her “cute son”."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Whilst being under the influence, she treats him with her usual indifference in front of Natsuki, but when they are alone, she turns into a spoiled, overprotective mother."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is also a very devoted and tender woman, and sometimes she even uses her boobs to make the main character fall in love with her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c138558"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"夏妃の母親で、主人公の義理の母。主人公の父親を騙し、再婚した毒婦。父親がいないときは素が出て主人公を邪魔者のように扱う。しかしそんな彼女も催眠薬により主人公を『可愛い息子』と誤認させられてしまい、暗示に掛かった後は夏妃の前ではいつも通り主人公に興味なさげに接しながら、ふたりきりのときはダダ甘なママと化し過保護ともいえる豹変ぶりを見せる。エッチに関しても甘えさせプレーが中心で、優しく献身的に時には嫉妬深く自慢のおっぱいを使ったプレーで主人公を蕩けさせる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25770","sourceWorkId":"36355","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【豊満な身体を持て余す淫乱爆乳オバギャル】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夏妃の母親で、主人公の義理の母。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の父親を騙し、再婚した毒婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"父親がいないときは素が出て主人公を邪魔者のように扱う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしそんな彼女も催○薬により主人公を『可愛い息子』と誤認させられてしまい、暗示に掛かった後は夏妃の前ではいつも通り主人公に興味なさげに接しながら、ふたりきりのときはダダ甘なママと化し過保護ともいえる豹変ぶりを見せる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エッチに関しても甘えさせプレーが中心で、優しく献身的に時には嫉妬深く自慢のおっぱいを使ったプレーで主人公を蕩けさせる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「なにマジマジと見てるの？　まるでケダモノね、身の危険を感じちゃうわ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"160628"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"120 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25770","sourceWorkId":"36355","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"m","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25770","sourceWorkId":"36355","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"171 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25770","sourceWorkId":"36355","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"98 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25770","sourceWorkId":"36355","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"65 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25770","sourceWorkId":"36355","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b46e243f7e83e81641765608c06a79a9676c878f6ad7b6a585a71f5e01233236.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/41/41ef76bc4b6a0cc09153bea3e631fa21c68659b8360bc261bf148f1f3c1edcd9.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"朝比奈幸","creatorId":"vndb:s21648","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s21648","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s21648","name":"朝比奈 幸","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:501681:160628:17080:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"綾音 まこ","creatorId":"vndb:s2581","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2581","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2581","name":"綾音 まこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:97633","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c138559","characterName":"桐谷 夏妃","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"160629","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"501681"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25771"],"vndbCharacterId":"c138559"},"originalCharacterName":"桐谷 夏妃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"102"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"K"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"164"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"93"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is Ikumi's daughter and the same age as the protagonist, but because Natsuki was born two months later, she is considered his younger sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is not happy about it and cannot stand being the younger sister of the protagonist, who is not very popular."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Therefore, she treats him ill, and like her mother, when her father is not around, she treats him as if he is her errand boy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist's hypnotism makes her recognize him as her “favorite handsome brother,” and she starts to aggressively try to get his attention through aggressive body communication and pampering."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c138559"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"育美の娘で主人公とは同い年だが、夏妃の方が誕生日が２カ月遅いことから妹ということになってしまう。本人はそれが納得いっておらず、うだつの上がらない主人公の風下に立つことが我慢ならない様子。ゆえに彼を邪険に扱い、母親同様に父親がいないときはそれこそ、パシリのように接している。今回、主人公の催眠術によって彼のことを『大好きなイケメンの兄』と認識させられてしまい、積極的なボディコミュニケーションや甘えプレーなどでなんとか気を引こうと積極的に絡んでくるようになる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25771","sourceWorkId":"36355","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【兄を舐めきったメ○ガキJKギャル】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"育美の娘で主人公とは同い年だが、夏妃の方が誕生日が2カ月遅いことから妹ということになってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人はそれが納得いっておらず、うだつの上がらない主人公の風下に立つことが我慢ならない様子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ゆえに彼を邪険に扱い、母親同様に父親がいないときはそれこそ、パシリのように接している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回、主人公の催○術によって彼のことを『大好きなイケメンの兄』と認識させられてしまい、積極的なボディコミュニケーションや甘えプレーなどでなんとか気を引こうと積極的に絡んでくるようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「マジキモイんだけど。こんな奴、あのおっさんがいない間に捨てちゃおうよ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"160629"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"102 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25771","sourceWorkId":"36355","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":